# §22.5 #8b wilderness-priest-revelation: pin the dungeon-context
# arm of priest revelation. Slot 1 priest at lv 1 (seed 5 wi=52,
# ma=52) just covers cost (40 + lv 1 = 41) without the lv knob —
# revelation is the cheapest dungeon-only priest spell.
#
# Path 1 from §22.8: walk to a wild-roll cave at seed 5 (cave
# triggers on walk 4 of an 82828282... oscillation), enter with E.
# Newline absorbers feed each ryl_pause inside the dungeon: one
# after E for the level-1 find_torches encounter, one after the
# spell flow for the post-cast D/A re-prompt loop, one after A for
# the leave-cavern ryl_pause.
#
# Pinned arm: ma cost passes (52 >= 41), debit fires (ma 52→11),
# chance(59) lands the find-object arm at this seed, category roll
# picks weapons (cat=0), inner roll picks Halbard (id 9). The T
# byte after Z15 takes the (T)ake branch of the menu_branch — the
# (L)eave branch (and the chance(59) nothing arm) are not pinned
# by this fixture.
RYL_FAKE_EPOCH=1700000000
RYL_FAKE_SEED=5
RYL_NO_DELAY=1
